---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
export const prerender = false;
const contents = ['Job scope & work sequence', 'Risk assessment & controls', 'Relevant COSHH assessments', 'Emergency arrangements', 'Briefing & sign-off sheets'];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
 <head><BaseHead title="SafeWork AI | Health & Safety | Trades Go Digital" description="Meet SafeWork AI: draft work packs, risk assessments and method statements, with a health and safety knowledge assistant." /></head>
 <body class="safework-office">
  <Header />
  <main>
   <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
     <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">TRADES GO DIGITAL / HEALTH & SAFETY</p>
      <p class="product">SafeWork <span>AI</span></p>
      <h1>The job comes first.<br /><em>Get the paperwork together.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Turn your job description into a draft work pack. Prepare risk assessments and method statements, or ask a workplace safety question in plain English.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/safework">Create a work pack <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#safety-advice">See the safety assistant →</a></div>
      <p class="availability">Public app access is being prepared.</p>
     </div>
     <aside class="pack" aria-label="Work pack contents illustration">
      <div class="pack-top"><span>SAFEWORK AI</span><span class="draft">DRAFT / FOR REVIEW</span></div>
      <p class="pack-label">YOUR JOB. YOUR COMPANY.</p>
      <h2>Site work pack</h2>
      <p class="pack-intro">Bring the work, the risks and the arrangements into one document.</p>
      <ol>{contents.map((item, i) => <li><span>{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>{item}</li>)}</ol>
      <div class="pack-bottom">Describe → Generate → Review → Print</div>
     </aside>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section id="work-packs" class="section wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">01 / PREPARE THE JOB</p>
    <div class="section-heading"><h2>Start with the work.<br />Build a pack around it.</h2><p>Enter the job description and address, then add confirmed site emergency details. SafeWork creates a draft that brings together the relevant paperwork.</p></div>
    <div class="cards">
     <article><span class="number">01</span><h3>Describe your job</h3><p>Include the tasks, workforce, equipment and site conditions. Add your company name and logo for a branded pack.</p></article>
     <article><span class="number">02</span><h3>Prepare the draft</h3><p>Bring together the work sequence, risk controls, relevant substance assessments and supporting forms. Missing details become points to confirm before work.</p></article>
     <article><span class="number">03</span><h3>Review, then use</h3><p>Check the draft against the actual site and complete the required fields. Download the pack as a document or print it in A4, including through your browser’s Save as PDF option.</p></article>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section id="safety-advice" class="advice">
    <div class="wrap advice-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / FIND YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2>A place to ask<br />your safety questions.</h2><p>Use the AI dashboard to ask about a task, request a draft document or find relevant guidance. The assistant draws on the app’s organised safety library and official reference sources.</p><p>Prefer a structured approach? The guided RAMS builder helps you work through risk assessments and method statements.</p></div>
     <div class="questions"><p class="eyebrow">EXAMPLE QUESTIONS</p><p>“What information do I need before writing RAMS for this job?”</p><p>“Help me find HSE guidance for working at height.”</p><p>“What should I confirm before preparing a COSHH assessment?”</p><small>Examples of questions you can ask, not safety instructions.</small></div>
    </div>
   </section>
   <section class="section wrap review"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WORK STARTS</p><h2>A useful draft.<br />A proper review.</h2></div><div><p>AI-generated packs need checking by a competent person against the actual work and site conditions. Complete missing details, confirm controls and brief the people doing the job before using a pack.</p><p>SafeWork supports preparation; it does not certify that a job is safe or that a document meets every applicable requirement.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.hse.gov.uk/simple-health-safety/risk/risk-assessment-template-and-examples.htm">Read HSE’s guidance on adapting risk assessments ↗</a></div></section>
   <section class="access wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">SAFEWORK AI</p><h2>Work packs and safety support,<br />in one workspace.</h2><p>Public access is being prepared. Contact Trades Go Digital to ask about availability.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/safework">Prepare your work pack <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
 </body>
</html>
<style>
 body{background:#f5f6f2;color:#15271f} .wrap{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 40px));margin-inline:auto} .hero{background:#10271f;color:#fff;padding:72px 0 80px;border-bottom:5px solid #d5ac50}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:65px;align-items:center}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#557263;margin:0 0 22px}.hero .eyebrow,.advice .eyebrow{color:#b4c9bc}.product{font-size:22px;font-weight:850;margin:0 0 18px}.product span{color:#d9b45f}h1{font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,55px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0 0 24px}h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#d9b45f}.lead{font-size:18px;color:#d1ddd5;max-width:560px}.actions{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:30px}.button{display:inline-flex;gap:28px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:5px;min-height:48px}.primary{background:#e0bd70;color:#15271f}.primary:hover{background:#efcf8b}.text-link{font-weight:700;text-underline-offset:5px}.availability{font-size:13px;color:#b4c9bc;margin-top:18px}.pack{background:#f9faf5;color:#183e2c;padding:30px;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:12px 12px 0 #ffffff0b;border-top:5px solid #d9b45f}.pack-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-weight:800;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em}.draft{color:#746035}.pack-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;margin:48px 0 8px;color:#62746a}.pack h2{font:36px/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 15px}.pack-intro{font-size:14px;color:#5b6a62}.pack ol{padding:0;list-style:none;margin:25px 0}.pack li{display:flex;gap:18px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #d9dfd8;font-size:14px;font-weight:650}.pack li span{color:#748777;font-size:11px}.pack-bottom{border-top:2px solid #29563d;padding-top:16px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em}.section{padding-block:78px}.section-heading,.review{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:65px}.section-heading{align-items:start;margin-bottom:32px}h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,38px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 20px}p{margin-top:0}.section-heading>p,.cards p,.review p{color:#536259}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.cards article{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe2d9;border-radius:5px;padding:28px}.number{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#53715d}.cards h3{font-size:21px;margin:25px 0 10px}.cards p{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:0}.advice{background:#17392d;color:#edf3ee;padding-block:70px}.advice-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:75px;align-items:center}.advice p:not(.eyebrow){color:#d1ddd5}.questions{border:1px solid #658072;padding:30px;border-radius:5px}.questions>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:19px;border-top:1px solid #426051;padding-top:18px}.questions small{color:#a8beaf;font-size:12px}.review .eyebrow{margin-bottom:18px}.access{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:30px;background:#e8eddf;border:1px solid #cdd8c4;padding:38px;margin-bottom:75px;border-radius:6px}.access p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.access .button{flex-shrink:0}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #28a5d2;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:760px){.hero-grid,.section-heading,.advice-grid,.review{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.hero{padding-block:42px}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section{padding-block:46px}.advice{padding-block:45px}.pack{padding:24px}.pack-label{margin-top:30px}.access{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:25px;margin-bottom:45px}.hero-grid{gap:40px}.questions{padding:23px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){:global(html){scroll-behavior:auto}}
body{background:#07111f url('/images/safework-office-background.png') center top / cover fixed no-repeat}.hero{background:rgba(7,17,31,.7)}.section{background:#fff;padding-inline:32px}.advice{background:rgba(7,17,31,.88)}.access{background:#fff}.primary{background:#f58220}.pack{border-top-color:#f58220}@media(max-width:760px){body{background-attachment:scroll}.section{padding-inline:20px}}

.hero,.pack,.pack li,.pack-bottom,.cards article,.questions,.questions>p:not(.eyebrow),.access{border:0}
:global(body>header),:global(body>footer){border:0}

:global(body.safework-office){background-color:#07111f;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(7,17,31,.48),rgba(7,17,31,.48)),url('/images/safework-office-background.png');background-size:auto, max(100vw,1200px) auto;background-position:center top;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll}
:global(body.safework-office main){background:transparent}
:global(body.safework-office>header),:global(body.safework-office>footer){background:rgba(7,17,31,.76);border:0}
:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-brand),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-contact-list),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-links),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-bottom),:global(body.safework-office footer li),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-contact-list p){border:0;box-shadow:none}
:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-contact-list),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-links){background:transparent}
.hero,.advice{background:rgba(7,17,31,.48)}
.hero .lead,.advice p:not(.eyebrow){color:#fff}

:global(html){min-height:100%;background:#07111f}
:global(body.safework-office){position:relative;isolation:isolate;background:none}
:global(body.safework-office)::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(rgba(7,17,31,.48),rgba(7,17,31,.48)),url('/images/safework-office-background.png') center center / cover no-repeat}
:global(body.safework-office>header),:global(body.safework-office>footer),:global(body.safework-office main),.hero,.advice,.workspace{background:transparent}
</style>
